  "BSGBIRTHDAY2021": {
    "sender": "System",
    "messageText": "Hello, warrior! I've got some info for you: the local brass are celebrating something today. I won't reveal all cards, but there is someone very interested in all this chaos in Tarkov, well, you get me. And so this brass decided to share some goodies with you for more fun. Here, take it, you'll need it. Enjoy!",
